OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors share experiences of
OL,4,Athreats and abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police and crime commissioner has
OL,7,Fsaid more needs to be done to improve
OL,8,Fsecurity of elected members as
OL,9,Fcouncillors describe receiving death
OL,10,Fthreats.
OL,12,FIt was revealed at a meeting of Devon
OL,13,Fand Cornwall Police and Crime Panel
OL,14,Flast week 27 crimes had been recorded
OL,15,Fover the past 12 months under Operation
OL,16,FFord, which was set up in 2025 to
OL,17,Fenhance the security and support
OL,18,Foffered to councillors.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
