OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors share experiences of
OL,4,Athreats and abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers described personal experiences
OL,7,Fof threats including one councillor who
OL,8,Ftold the meeting he had a car driven at
OL,9,Fhim, the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,10,FService said.
OL,12,FPolice and Crime Commissioner Alison
OL,13,FHernandez criticised Operation Ford as
OL,14,Fnot much more than a "bureaucratic
OL,15,Finbox".
